ion" xml:lang="zh-Hans">既然要把我们视作眼中钉</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">既然要把我們視作眼中釘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If you are going to treat us as enemies</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리를 눈엣가시로 여긴다면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si vous vous obstinez à nous prendre pour cible</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si nos vas a tratar como enemigos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn ihr uns zum Feindbild macht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Se vocês vão nos tratar como inimigas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Раз уж вы так ополчились на нас</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se ci prendete come nemici</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Bokura o menokataki ni suru nara</span></p><p begin="35.630" end="38.660" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.630" end="35.760">そ</span><span begin="35.760" end="35.860">ん</span><span begin="35.860" end="35.930">な</span><span begin="35.930" end="36.020">ら</span><span begin="36.020" end="36.100">こ</span><span begin="36.100" end="36.200">っ</span><span begin="36.200" end="36.290">ち</span><span begin="36.290" end="36.380">も</span><span begin="36.380" end="36.550">容</span><span begin="36.550" end="36.680">赦</span><span begin="36.890" end="37.060">は</span><span begin="37.060" end="37.380">し</span><span begin="37.470" end="37.750">な</span><span begin="37.830" end="38.080">い</span><span begin="38.160" end="38.660">ぜ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那这边也绝不会手下留情哦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那這邊也絕不會手下留情哦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Then we won&apos;t show any mercy either</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그렇다면 우리도 봐주지 않겠어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Alors nous ne ferons pas de quartier non plus</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Entonces nosotros tampoco tendremos piedad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Dann werden wir auch keine Gnade zeigen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Então nós também não teremos piedade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">То и мы не проявим пощады</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Allora non avremo pietà neanche noi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sonnara kotchi mo yousha wa shinai ze</span></p><p begin="39.170" end="42.840" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.170" end="39.610">学</span><span begin="39.610" end="39.970">園</span><span begin="40.270" end="40.640">戦</span><span begin="40.640" end="41.060">線</span> <span begin="41.330" end="41.620">は</span><span begin="41.710" end="41.920">み</span><span begin="42.040" end="42.280">出</span><span begin="42.390" end="42.840">せ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">学园战线 突破界限吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">學園戰線 突破界限吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">School wars step out of line</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">학원전선 한계를 벗어나</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Front scolaire dépassez les limites</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Frente escolar rompe los límites</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Schulfront sprengt die Grenzen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Frente de batalha escolar ultrapasse os limites</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Школьный фронт прорывай границы</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Fronte scolastico usciamo fuori dagli schemi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Gakuen sensen hamidase</span></p><p begin="43.380" end="44.230" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.380" end="43.410">“</span><span begin="43.410" end="43.760">じゃあ</span><span begin="43.870" end="44.200">ね</span><span begin="44.200" end="44.230">”</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">