" xml:lang="ko">엉망진창인 채로 나아가자고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Avançons même en restant tout emmêlés</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sigamos adelante así todos enredados</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lass uns einfach so völlig verheddert weitergehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos continuar assim todas emaranhadas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Давай продолжим прямо в этой путанице</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Andiamo avanti anche se siamo tutti aggrovigliati</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kongaragatta mama de ikou ze</span></p><p begin="54.920" end="57.160" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.920" end="55.280">思</span><span begin="55.280" end="55.350">い</span><span begin="55.430" end="55.620">込</span><span begin="55.620" end="55.780">み</span><span begin="55.780" end="55.990">さ</span><span begin="55.990" end="56.160">え</span><span begin="56.160" end="56.460">も</span><span begin="56.460" end="56.870">才</span><span begin="56.870" end="57.160">能</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就连一厢情愿也是种天赋</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就連一廂情願也是種天賦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even having fixed ideas is a talent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">멋대로 믿는 것조차 재능이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même nos convictions aveugles sont un talent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Incluso creer ciegamente es un talento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sogar reine Einbildung ist ein Talent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Até mesmo criar ilusões é um talento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже слепая вера это талант</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Persino le nostre fisse sono un talento</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Omoikomi sae mo sainou</span></p><p begin="57.390" end="59.340" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.390" end="57.530">理</span><span begin="57.530" end="57.740">解</span><span begin="57.740" end="57.840">っ</span><span begin="57.840" end="58.100">て</span><span begin="58.100" end="58.270">も</span><span begin="58.270" end="58.410">ら</span><span begin="58.410" end="58.550">え</span><span begin="58.550" end="58.700">な</span><span begin="58.700" end="58.810">い</span><span begin="58.810" end="58.970">な</span><span begin="58.970" end="59.340">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">既然无法得到理解</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">既然無法得到理解</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If they won&apos;t understand us</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이해받지 못한다면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">S&apos;ils ne peuvent pas nous comprendre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si no pueden entendernos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn sie uns schon nicht verstehen wollen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Se eles não conseguem nos entender</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Если они не хотят нас понимать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se non riusciamo a farci capire</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Wakatte moraenai nara</span></p><p begin="59.520" end="1:02.150" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.520" end="59.590">ひ</span><span begin="59.690" end="59.760">た</span><span begin="59.840" end="1:00.050">す</span><span begin="1:00.050" end="1:00.230">ら</span><span begin="1:00.230" end="1:00.400">に</span><span begin="1:00.400" end="1:00.680">挑</span><span begin="1:00.680" end="1:00.760">ん</span><span begin="1:00.760" end="1:00.830">で</span><span begin="1:00.830" end="1:00.930">ゆ</span><span begin="1:00.930" end="1:01.110">く</span><span begin="1:01.110" end="1:01.450">物</span><span begin="1:01.450" end="1:02.150">語</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那就演绎一场不断发起挑战的故事</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那就演繹一場不斷發起挑戰的故事</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A story of relentlessly taking on challenges</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그저 끝없이 부딪혀가는 이야기를</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C&apos;est l&apos;histoire d&apos;un défi que nous relèverons sans relâche</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Es una historia de desafiar constantemente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Eine Geschichte die einfach unerbittlich herausfordert</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Então esta é uma história onde apenas continuamos desafiando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Это история нашего неустанного вызова</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Una storia in cui continueremo a sfidare tutto ciecamente</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hitasura ni idonde yuku monogatari</span></p><p begin="1:02.470" end="1:03.570" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.470" end="1:02.590">見</span><span begin="1:02.590" end="1:02.800">せ</span><span begin="1:02.800" end="1:02.870">つ</span><span begin="1:02.870" end="1:02.980">け</span><span begin="1:03.060" end="1:03.130">て</span><span begin="1:03.210" end="1:03.540">こ</span><span begin="1:03.540" end="1:03.570">！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">展现给他们看吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">展現給他們看吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let&apos;s show it off!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">똑똑히 보여주자고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Montrons-leur ce dont nous sommes capables</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Vamos a demostrárselo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Zeigen wir es ihnen!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos mostrar pra eles</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Покажем им всё</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mostriamoglielo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Misetsukete ko!</span></p><p begin="1:03.590" end="1:06.000" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.590" end="1:03.930">ラ</span><span begin="1:03.930" end="1:04.290">ラ</span><span begin="1:04.290" end="1:04.660">ラ</span><span begin="1:04.660" end="1:05.010">ラ</span><span begin="1:05.010" end="1:05.350">ラ</span><span begin="1:05.350" end="1:05.720">ラ</span><span begin="1:05.720" end="1:06.000">ラ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啦啦啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啦啦啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">라라라라라라라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ла-ла-ла-ла-ла-ла-ла</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Rarararararara</span></p><p begin="1:06.000" end="1:08.140" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.000" end="1:06.230">こ</span><span begin="1:06.230" end="1:06.310">ん</span><span begin="1:06.310" end="1:06.410">な</span><span begin="1:06.410" end="1:06.620">僕</span><span begin="1:06.620" end="1:06.750">ら</span><span begin="1:06.750" end="1:06.980">だ</span><span begin="1:06.980" end="1:07.130">っ</span><span begin="1:07.130" end="1:07.440">て</span><span begin="1:07.440" end="1:07.720">叫</span><span begin="1:07.820" end="1:08.140">ぶ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使是这样的我们也会放声呐喊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">即使是這樣的我們也會放聲吶喊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even people like us shout out</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이런 우리라도 소리칠 테니</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même des gens comme nous savent hurler</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Incluso personas como nosotros gritan</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sogar solche wie wir schreien auf</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Até garotas como nós gritam</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже такие как мы будут кричать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche noi così gridiamo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Konna bokura datte sakebu</span></p><p begin="1:08.160" end="1:09.210" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.160" end="1:08.250">見</span><span begin="1:08.250" end="1:08.450">せ</span><span begin="1:08.450" end="1:08.530">つ</span><span begin="1:08.530" end="1:08.700">け</span><span begin="1:08.700" end="1:08.780">て</span><span begin="1:08.870" end="1:09.180">こ</span><span begin="1:09.180" end="1:09.210">！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">展现给他们看吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">展現給他們看吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let&apos;s show it off!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">똑똑히 보여주자고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Montrons-leur ce dont nous sommes capables</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Vamos a demostrárselo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Zeigen wir es ihnen!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos mostrar pra eles</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Покажем им всё</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mostriamoglielo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Misetsukete ko!</span></p><p begin="1:09.180" end="1:11.650" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.180" end="1:09.580">ラ</span><span begin="1:09.580" end="1:09.950">ラ</span><span begin="1:09.950" end="1:10.300">ラ</span><span begin="1:10.300" end="1:1