ous attend au juste</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Qué nos estará esperando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Unserer Welt auf uns wartet</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">No nosso mundo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В нашем мире</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Nel nostro mondo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nani ga matteru no darou</span></p><p begin="1:56.680" end="1:59.230" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.680" end="1:56.860">切</span><span begin="1:56.860" end="1:57.210">り</span><span begin="1:57.210" end="1:57.790">開</span><span begin="1:57.790" end="1:57.940">い</span><span begin="1:57.940" end="1:58.000">て</span><span begin="1:58.110" end="1:58.530">こ</span><span begin="1:58.530" end="1:59.230">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">劈开前路吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">劈開前路吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let&apos;s carve it open</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">헤쳐 나아가자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Traçons notre propre chemin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Vamos a abrirnos camino</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lass uns einen Weg bahnen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos abrir o caminho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Давай проложим себе путь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Apriamo la nostra strada</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kirihiraite kou</span></p><p begin="1:59.660" end="2:02.400" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.660" end="1:59.840">こ</span><span begin="1:59.840" end="1:59.970">ん</span><span begin="1:59.970" end="2:00.210">が</span><span begin="2:00.210" end="2:00.300">ら</span><span begin="2:00.380" end="2:00.580">が</span><span begin="2:00.580" end="2:00.670">っ</span><span begin="2:00.670" end="2:00.930">た</span><span begin="2:00.930" end="2:01.000">ま</span><span begin="2:01.110" end="2:01.330">ま</span><span begin="2:01.440" end="2:01.660">で</span><span begin="2:01.660" end="2:01.720">い</span><span begin="2:01.810" end="2:02.130">こう</span><span begin="2:02.130" end="2:02.400">ぜ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样保持着一团糟继续前进吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就這樣保持著一團糟繼續前進吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let&apos;s just go while staying all tangled up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">엉망진창인 채로 나아가자고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Avançons même en restant tout emmêlés</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sigamos adelante así todos enredados</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lass uns einfach so völlig verheddert weitergehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos continuar assim todas emaranhadas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Давай продолжим прямо в этой путанице</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Andiamo avanti anche se siamo tutti aggrovigliati</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kongaragatta mama de ikou ze</span></p><p begin="2:02.660" end="2:04.960" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:02.660" end="2:02.930">君</span><span begin="2:03.030" end="2:03.220">と</span><span begin="2:03.220" end="2:03.280">行</span><span begin="2:03.370" end="2:03.450">け</span><span begin="2:03.560" end="2:03.770">た</span><span begin="2:03.770" end="2:03.900">ら</span><span begin="2:03.900" end="2:04.240">超</span><span begin="2:04.240" end="2:04.500">さ</span><span begin="2:04.500" end="2:04.620">い</span><span begin="2:04.620" end="2:04.960">こー</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果能和你同行那真是最棒了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如果能和你同行那真是最棒了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It would be super awesome if I could go with you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너와 함께 간다면 더할 나위 없지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ce serait super génial de pouvoir y aller avec toi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sería súper genial si pudiera ir contigo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn ich mit dir gehen könnte wäre das absolut genial</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ir com você seria super demais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Пойти вместе с тобой было бы просто супер</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se vado insieme a te è il massimo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi to iketara chou saikoo</span></p><p begin="2:05.150" end="2:07.060" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.150" end="2:05.330">理</span><span begin="2:05.330" end="2:05.500">解</span><span begin="2:05.500" end="2:05.610">っ</span><span begin="2:05.610" end="2:05.840">て</span><span begin="2:05.840" end="2:06.040">も</span><span begin="2:06.040" end="2:06.190">ら</span><span begin="2:06.190" end="2:06.310">え</span><span begin="2:06.310" end="2:06.480">な</span><span begin="2:06.480" end="2:06.570">い</span><span begin="2:06.570" end="2:06.740">な</span><span begin="2:06.740" end="2:07.060">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">既然无法得到理解</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">既然無法得到理解</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If they won&apos;t understand us</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이해받지 못한다면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">S&apos;ils ne peuvent pas nous comprendre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si no pueden entendernos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn sie uns schon nicht verstehen wollen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Se eles não conseguem nos entender</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Если они не хотят нас понимать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se non riusciamo a farci capire</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Wakatte moraenai nara</span></p><p begin="2:07.240" end="2:09.890" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:07.240" end="2:07.330">ひ</span><span begin="2:07.450" end="2:07.590">た</span><span begin="2:07.590" end="2:07.790">す</span><span begin="2:07.790" end="2:08.010">ら</span><span begin="2:08.010" end="2:08.160">に</span><span begin="2:08.160" end="2:08.450">挑</span><span begin="2:08.450" end="2:08.530">ん</span><span begin="2:08.530" end="2:08.590">で</span><span begin="2:08.590" end="2:08.680">ゆ</span><span begin="2:08.680" end="2:08.870">く</span><span begin="2:08.870" end="2:09.210">物</span><span begin="2:09.210" end="2:09.890">語</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那就演绎一场不断发起挑战的故事</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那就演繹一場不斷發起挑戰的故事</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A story of relentlessly taking on challenges</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그저 끝없이 부딪혀가는 이야기를</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C&apos;est l&apos;histoire d&apos;un défi que nous relèverons sans relâche</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Es una historia de desafiar constantemente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Eine Geschichte die einfach unerbittlich herausfordert</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Então esta é uma história onde apenas continuamos desafiando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Это история нашего неустанного вызова</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Una storia in cui continueremo a sfidare tutto ciecamente</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hitasura ni idonde yuku monogatari</span></p><p begin="2:10.230" end="2:11.320" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:10.230" end="2:10.350">見</span><span begin="2:10.350" end="2:10.560">せ</span><span begin="2:10.560" end="2:10.640">つ</span><span begin="2:10.640" end="2:10.830">け</span><span begin="2:10.830" end="2:10.900">て</span><span begin="2:10.980" end="2:11.290">こ</span><span begin="2:11.290" end="2:11.320">！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">展现给他们看吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">展現給他們看吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let&apos;s show it off!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">똑똑히 보여주자고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Montrons-leur ce dont nous sommes capables</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Vamos a demostrárselo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Zeigen wir es ihnen!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos mostrar pra eles</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Покажем им всё</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mostriamoglielo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Misetsukete ko!</span></p><p begin="2:11.300" end="2:13.760" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:11.300" end="2:11.680">ラ</span><span begin="2:11.680" end="2:12.070">ラ</span><span begin="2:12.070" end="2:12.430">ラ</span><span begin="2:12.430" end="2:12.770">ラ</span><span begin="2:12.770" end="2:13.120">ラ</span><span begin="2:13.120" end="2:13.480">ラ</span><span begin="2:13.480" end="2:13.760">ラ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啦啦啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啦啦啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">라라라라라라라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ла-ла-ла-ла-ла-ла-ла</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Rarararararara</span></p><p begin="2:13.790" end="2:15.890" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:13.790" end="2:13.950">た</span><span begin="2:13.950" end="2:14.070">ま</span><span begin="2:14.070" end="2:14.180">にゃ</span><span begin="2:14.180" end="2:14.390">僕</span><span begin="2:14.390" end="2:14.520">ら</span><span begin="2:14.520" end="2:14.730">だ</span><span begin="2:14.730" end="2:14.890">っ</span><span begin="2:14.890" end="2:15.070">て</span><span begin="2:15.230" end="2:15.480">嘆</span><span begin="2:15.570" end="2:15.890">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">偶尔我们也会发发牢骚</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">偶爾我們也會發發牢騷</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Sometimes even people like us lament</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">가끔은 우리도 한숨 쉬겠지만</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Parfois même des gens comme nous se lamentent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">De vez en cuando nosotros también nos lamentamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Manchmal klagen auch solche wie wir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Às vezes até garotas como nós lamentam</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Иногда даже мы сокрушаемся</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">A volte anche noi ci lamentiamo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tamanya bokura datte nageku</span></p><p begin="2:15.920" end="2:16.910" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:15.920" end="2:16.000">見</span><span begin="2:16.000" end="2:16.220">せ</span><span begin="2:16.220" end="2:16.280">つ</span><span begin="2:16.280" end="2:16.470">け</span><span begin="2:16.470" end="2:16.530">て</span><span begin="2:16.620" end="2:16.880">こ</span><span begin="2:16.880" end="2:16.910">！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">展现给他们看吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">展現給他們看吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let&apos;s show it off!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">똑똑히 보여주자고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Montrons-leur ce dont nous sommes capables</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Vamos a demostrárselo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Zeigen wir es ihnen!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos mostrar pra eles</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Покажем им всё</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mostriamoglielo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Misetsukete ko!</span></p><p begin="2:16.950" end="2:19.370" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:16.950" end="2:17.340">ラ</span><span begin="2:17.340" end="2:17.720">ラ</span><span begin="2:17.720" end="2:18.070">ラ</span><span begin="2:18.070" end="2:18.440">ラ</span><span begin="2:18.440" end="2:18.760">ラ</span><span begin="2:18.760" end="2:19.120">ラ</span><span begin="2:19.120" end="2:19.370">ラ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啦啦啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啦啦啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">라라라라라라라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Lalalalalalala</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ла-ла-ла-ла-ла-ла-ла</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La la la la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Rarararararara</span></p><p begin="2:19.430" end="2:20.820" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:19.430" end="2:19.560">で</span><span begin="2:19.560" end="2:19.650">ん</span><span begin="2:19.650" end="2:19.710">ぐ</span><span begin="2:19.710" end="2:19.810">り</span><span begin="2:19.810" end="2:19.980">返</span><span begin="2:19.980" end="2:20.150">し</span> <span begin="2: