="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un secret invincible</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Un secreto invencible</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ein unbesiegbares Geheimnis</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Um segredo invencível</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Непобедимый секрет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Un segreto invincibile</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Muteki no shiikuretto</span></p><p begin="2:51.880" end="2:54.650" itunes:key="L53" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:51.880" end="2:52.060">こ</span><span begin="2:52.060" end="2:52.200">ん</span><span begin="2:52.200" end="2:52.480">が</span><span begin="2:52.480" end="2:52.610">ら</span><span begin="2:52.610" end="2:52.820">が</span><span begin="2:52.820" end="2:52.900">っ</span><span begin="2:52.900" end="2:53.070">た</span><span begin="2:53.160" end="2:53.240">ま</span><span begin="2:53.350" end="2:53.570">ま</span><span begin="2:53.700" end="2:53.880">で</span><span begin="2:53.880" end="2:53.940">い</span><span begin="2:54.040" end="2:54.290">こう</span><span begin="2:54.380" end="2:54.650">ぜ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样保持着一团糟继续前进吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就這樣保持著一團糟繼續前進吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let&apos;s just go while staying all tangled up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">엉망진창인 채로 나아가자고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Avançons même en restant tout emmêlés</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sigamos adelante así todos enredados</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lass uns einfach so völlig verheddert weitergehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos continuar assim todas emaranhadas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Давай продолжим прямо в этой путанице</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Andiamo avanti anche se siamo tutti aggrovigliati</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kongaragatta mama de ikou ze</span></p><p begin="2:54.900" end="2:57.140" itunes:key="L54" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:54.900" end="2:55.260">思</span><span begin="2:55.260" end="2:55.330">い</span><span begin="2:55.430" end="2:55.630">込</span><span begin="2:55.630" end="2:55.770">み</span><span begin="2:55.770" end="2:55.950">さ</span><span begin="2:55.950" end="2:56.170">え</span><span begin="2:56.170" end="2:56.480">も</span><span begin="2:56.480" end="2:56.850">才</span><span begin="2:56.850" end="2:57.140">能</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就连一厢情愿也是种天赋</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就連一廂情願也是種天賦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even having fixed ideas is a talent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">멋대로 믿는 것조차 재능이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même nos convictions aveugles sont un talent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Incluso creer ciegamente es un talento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sogar reine Einbildung ist ein Talent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Até mesmo criar ilusões é um talento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже слепая вера это талант</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Persino le nostre fisse sono un talento</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Omoikomi sae mo sainou</span></p><p begin="2:57.380" end="2:59.320" itunes:key="L55" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:57.380" end="2:57.480">理</span><span begin="2:57.560" end="2:57.750">解</span><span begin="2:57.750" end="2:57.840">っ</span><span begin="2:57.840" end="2:58.070">て</span><span begin="2:58.070" end="2:58.260">も</span><span begin="2:58.260" end="2:58.420">ら</span><span begin="2:58.420" end="2:58.540">え</span><span begin="2:58.540" end="2:58.710">な</span><span begin="2:58.710" end="2:58.800">い</span><span begin="2:58.800" end="2:58.890">な</span><span begin="2:58.970" end="2:59.320">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">既然无法得到理解</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">既然無法得到理解</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If they won&apos;t understand us</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이해받지 못한다면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">S&apos;ils ne peuvent pas nous comprendre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si no pueden entendernos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn sie uns schon nicht verstehen wollen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Se eles não conseguem nos entender</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Если они не хотят нас понимать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se non riusciamo a farci capire</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Wakatte moraenai nara</span></p><p begin="2:59.510" end="3:02.170" itunes:key="L56" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:59.510" end="2:59.590">ひ</span><span begin="2:59.680" end="2:59.810">た</span><span begin="2:59.810" end="3:00.040">す</span><span begin="3:00.040" end="3:00.240">ら</span><span begin="3:00.240" end="3:00.330">に</span><span begin="3:00.410" end="3:00.650">挑</span><span begin="3:00.650" end="3:00.750">ん</span><span begin="3:00.750" end="3:00.820">で</span><span begin="3:00.820" end="3:00.900">ゆ</span><span begin="3:00.900" end="3:01.110">く</span><span begin="3:01.110" end="3:01.450">物</span><span begin="3:01.450" end="3:02.170">語</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那就演绎一场不断发起挑战的故事</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那就演繹一場不斷發起挑戰的故事</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A story of relentlessly taking on challenges</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그저 끝없이 부딪혀가는 이야기를</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C&apos;est l&apos;histoire d&apos;un défi que nous relèverons sans relâche</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Es una historia de desafiar constantemente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Eine Geschichte die einfach unerbittlich herausfordert</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Então esta é uma história onde apenas continuamos desafiando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Это история нашего неустанного вызова</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Una storia in cui continueremo a sfidare tutto ciecamente</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hitasura ni idonde yuku monogatari</span></p><p begin="3:02.480" end="3:03.550" itunes:key="L57" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:02.480" end="3:02.570">見</span><span begin="3:02.570" end="3:02.790">せ</span><span begin="3:02.790" end="3:02.870">つ</span><span begin="3:02.870" end="3:03.050">け</span><span begin="3:03.050" end="3:03.120">て</span><span begin="3:03.210" end="3:03.520">こ</span><span begin="3:03.520" end="3:03.550">！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">展现给他们看吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">展現給他們看吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let&apos;s show it off!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">똑똑히 보여주자고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Montrons-leur ce dont nous sommes capables</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Vamos a demostrárselo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Zeigen wir es ihnen!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos mostrar pra eles</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Покажем им всё</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mostriamoglielo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Misetsukete ko!</span></p><p begin="3:03.540" end="3:06.000" itunes:key="L58" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:03.540" end="3:03.940">ラ</span><span begin="3:03.940" end="3:04.300">ラ</span><span begin="3:04.300" end="3:04.650">ラ</span><span begin="3:04.650" end="3:05.010">ラ</span><span begin="3:05.010" end="3:05.360">ラ</span><span begin="3:05.360" end="3:05.730">ラ</span><span begin="